OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Worthless' shoebox coins sell for
OL,4,A#28k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwelve rare Chinese coins, found in a
OL,7,Fshoebox and dismissed as "worthless" by
OL,8,Fthe former owner, have sold for #28,000
OL,9,Fat auction in Kent.
OL,11,FThe collection was expected to fetch
OL,12,Fbetween #100 and #200, but bidding
OL,13,Fsoared as two Chinese buyers battled it
OL,14,Fout in the Hansons saleroom in
OL,15,FPenshurst, prompting applause when the
OL,16,Fhammer finally fell.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32202
