OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1795706759
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Worthless' shoebox coins sell for
OL,4,A#28k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the coins was a highly
OL,7,Fsought-after 1914 silver dollar
OL,8,Ffeaturing Yuan Shikai, the first
OL,9,FPresident of the Republic of China,
OL,10,Fdepicted wearing an elaborate plumed
OL,11,Fmilitary hat.
OL,13,FCharles Hanson, who was on the rostrum,
OL,14,Fdescribed the items as the "ultimate
OL,15,Fsleeper", adding the result was
OL,16,F"incredible" and "you cannot beat the
OL,17,Fdrama of a live auction".
